+ *     pointed at somebody else's inbox;
+ *   • not to a verified, disabled or address-less account, nor one created in the last
+ *     day (its sign-up mail is still fresh);
+ *   • not to an address that was sent one in the last 24 hours, by staff or by the person
+ *     themselves (the marker), and not while another staff send to it is in flight.
+ * One run at a time; one send a second; one retry on a 429. A call stops taking accounts
+ * after VERIFY_CALL_BUDGET_MS and returns the rest as `notAttempted` for the console to
